 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API access and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` holds `{ key, name, role }` records, with roles `viewer`, `cook`,
+or `manager`. `audit` is an append-only array of `{ time, name, method, path,
+status }` records for API requests that save data. API writes persist their
+audit entry in the same save. Migration from schema 2 preserves existing
+fields and initializes missing arrays empty; provision keys in the data file.
